                "title": " Vitalik Buterin reclaims \u2018onchain billionaire\u2019 crown as Ether tops $4.2K ",
                "text": "\n                \n                    <p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjUtMDIvMDE5NTIzNWEtMDEyYi03MmZiLWE5ZTQtODg1ZTJhYjNkOTMz.jpg\" alt=\"Vitalik Buterin reclaims \u2018onchain billionaire\u2019 crown as Ether tops $4.2K\"></p><p>Vitalik Buterin's net worth could be bolstered even more as crypto traders are eyeing new all-time highs for Ether in just days.</p>\n                                ",
